flowchart LR
    Creator[Authenticated Creator] --> Gateway[Global API Gateway]
    Recipient[Anonymous Recipient] --> Gateway
    Gateway --> Management[Management Service]
    Gateway --> Consumption[Public Consumption Service]
    Management -->|Create / Revoke| Primary[(PostgreSQL Primary)]
    Management -->|List / Detail| Replicas[(Read Replicas)]
    Consumption --> Redis[(Redis)]
    Consumption -->|Atomic ACTIVE → CONSUMED| Primary
    Primary --> Outbox[Transactional Outbox]
    Outbox --> Audit[Audit / Analytics Pipeline]
    Consumption --> KMS[KMS]
    Consumption --> ObjectStore[Private Object Storage]
    Expiry[Expiry Sweeper] --> Primary
